    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeremia yayilwa mumbohe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 37:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zedekia waYosia, owa Nebukhadineza omuruchi waBabeli yeemekha okhuba omuruchi mushialo shiaYuda, yarukayo, mushilenje shiaKonia waYehoyakimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.37.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.37.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 37:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kata ye, kata abasumbabe, kata abandu beshialo, shibahulilanga amakhuwa kOMWAMI aka yaboolanga nomunabii Yeremia ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.37.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.37.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 37:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.37.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.37.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 37:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuruchi Zedekia yaruma Yehukali waShelemia naZefania waMaaseeya omukuhani khumunabii Yeremia, okhusunga mbu Bulaano okhusaayile ewOMWAMI Nyasaye weefwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.37.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.37.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 37:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Yeremia yali nasamulanga niyeenjila mubandu; shichila yali narashiabohwa mucheela ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.37.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.37.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 37:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne lihe liaFarao liali nilirulile muMisiri; ne olwa abaKalidayo abali nibeekaliile Yerusalemu bahulila amakhuwa ako, basambula ikambi yabwe nibarula eYerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.37.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.37.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 37:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.37.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.37.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 37:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana likhuwa liOMWAMI nilimwitsila Yeremia, liri ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.37.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.37.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 37:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kano niko aka OMWAMI, Nyasaye waIsiraeli, aboola; mbu Kano niko aka olaboolela omuruchi waYuda, owakhuruma khwisie okhureebakhwo; mbu Lola, lihe liaFarao, elimlile mbu likhuhabine, lilakalukha eMisiri mushialo shiabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.37.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.37.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 37:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo abaKalidayo baleetsa khandi nibaseera litookho iino, nibalibukula, nibalisamba nomulilo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.37.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.37.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 37:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kano niko aka OMWAMI aboola; mbu Mureekaatinjia abeene mbu AbaKalidayo balakhurulakhwo, ta; okhuba snibalamurulakhwo tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.37.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.37.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 37:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba kata nimwakharootsile lihe liosi pe liabaKalidayo elimuseeranga, nibakhatong'ile abafumirwa bonyene khubo, khane bakhabuukha buli mundu mwiheemalie nibasamba litookho lino nomulilo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.37.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.37.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 37:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.37.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.37.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 37:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa lih liabaKalidayo liali nilisambuule ikambi yabwe nibarulile eYerusaiemu khulwa okhuria lihe liaFarao, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.37.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.37.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 37:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeremia yarula eYerusalemu nabuusia oluchendo okhutsia mushialo shiaBenyamini, okhulia omukabokwe ebweneyo mubandube. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.37.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.37.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 37:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa yali nali hashilibwa shiaBenyamini, omundu omuhenji yali naliyo, owa eliiralie liali Iriya waShelemia waHanania; naye namutiila Yeremia omunabii, nasunga mbu Oswekhanga notsia khubaKalidayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.37.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.37.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 37:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeremia nakalusia mbu Nobubeeyi; shiswekha ninzia khubaKalidayo ta; nebutswa Iriya yakhaya okhumuhulila; namutiila Yeremia, namuyila ewabakhulundu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.37.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.37.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 37:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo abakhulundu nibamutiililwa Yeremia oburima, nibamukhupa nibamuboha munzu yaYonatsani omuhandiichi; okhuba balinibachikholile icheela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.37.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.37.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Zedekia nasungana nende Yeremia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 37:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.37.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.37.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 37:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olwa Yeremia yali niyayililwe munzu yeimbohe, mukhasika khomubwina, niyamenyileyo tsindaalo tsinyinji, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.37.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.37.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 37:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "omuruchi Zedekia yaruma abandu okhumwenda; omuruchi nasungana ninaye mabiswi munzuye, namureeba mbu Liliho likhuwa liosi elirula khuMWAMI? Yeremia nakalusia mbu Liliho. Nameeta nasunga mbu Witsa okhuhaanwa mumukhono kwomuruchi waBabeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.37.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.37.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 37:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi Yeremia nasunjila omuruchi Zedekia ari Ndakhwonoonela shiina, kata okhwonoonela abasumbabo, kata lihanga lino, akachila nimumboha mucheela? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.37.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.37.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 37:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bulaano bali heena abanabiibo abakhurumbulila muliira liOMWAMI mbu Omuruchi waBabeli shialakhuseera kata okhuseera eshialo shmo ta? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.37.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.37.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 37:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne bulaano, chama umbulile, omwami wanje omuruchi; chama okhusaaya khwanje khuule imbeliwo, mbu orangalusia munzu yaYonatsani omuhandiichi, endeshe okhufwilayo ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.37.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.37.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 37:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Zedekia omuruchi nalaka, nibamwinjisia Yeremia mulwanyi lwabalindi, nibamukabila buli nyanga omukaate mulala okhurula khunjila yabateeshi bemikaate, okhuula olwa emikaate chiosi chiali nichihweele mwitookho. Yeremia namenya ario mulwanyi lwabalindi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.37.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.37.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
